### Prueba de endpoint de conductores con REST Client
### Define BALANZA_API_TOKEN en el entorno de VS Code/REST Client o reemplaza {{privateKey}}.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8848/Bee-Framework/api
@privateKey = {{privateKey}}

### CONSULTAR CONDUCTORES
GET {{baseUrl}}/conductores HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{privateKey}}
